# {{lb|en|basketball}} A shot that is scored while the ball is in play (i.e. not a [[free throw]]).
#: {{ux|en|He got six '''field goals''' in the first half, two from three-point land.}}
# {{lb|en|rugby}} A goal scored where a ball that is in play but on the ground is kicked through the uprights and over the crossbar.

